  A-->>GA: POST measurement payload
  V->>H: Click WhatsApp CTA
  H->>A: emit support_channel_click {channel_id:"whatsapp"}
  H-->>V: Open https://wa.me/... deep link
  V->>H: Submit contact form
  H->>F: POST hashed email + message (IC-7)
